---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT t.a, g.n FROM (SELECT a, count(*) AS n FROM u GROUP BY a) g RIGHT JOIN (SELECT a FROM t WHERE b = 'x') t ON g.a = t.a"
---
Project [a#3, n#2]
+- Join RightOuter, (a#0 == a#3)
   :- Aggregate [a#0], [a#0, count(1) AS n#2]
   :  +- Join LeftSemi, (a#0 == a#9)
   :     :- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#0]
   :     +- Shift +6
   :        +- Project [a#3]
   :           +- Filter (b#4 == 'x') (shared #1)
   :              +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#3, b#4]
   +- Project [a#3]
      +- Shared #1, printed above
